---
import { CREDENTIALS } from '../data/content';
import SectionHeader from './SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="section about">
  <div class="container--narrow">
    <SectionHeader label="Who we are" compact>
      Alec Wantoch &amp; Zach Pelkey
    </SectionHeader>
    <div data-fade data-fade-delay="0.05">
      <p class="text-mono-sm about__subtitle">Founder&#8209;Led Product Studio</p>
    </div>
    <div data-fade data-fade-delay="0.1">
      <p class="text-body-lg about__text about__text--strong">
        BeemFlow is a founder&#8209;led product studio. Every engagement is led
        by Alec and Zach, two founder&#8209;engineers with an exit, plus a small
        bench of senior specialists we've shipped multiple products with (product
        design, infra, and security). You work directly with us; we build the
        squad around you.
      </p>
      <p class="text-body-lg about__text">
        We co&#8209;founded Valist, raised from 2048 Ventures, and led the
        acquisition into HyperPlay. Post&#8209;acquisition, we ran product and
        security through HyperPlay's Series A and 100K+ downloads. We've shipped
        15+ products across fintech, infrastructure, and education, with roots in
        security engineering: pentesting, applied cryptography, and infrastructure
        hardening.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div data-fade data-fade-delay="0.15">
      <p class="text-body-lg about__text">
        Now we run BeemFlow and build every client product using BeemSpec, our
        AI&#8209;native coordination system. That's how a small, senior team
        consistently ships like a much larger one.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="about__credentials" data-fade data-fade-delay="0.2">
      {CREDENTIALS.map((cred) =>
        cred.href ? (
          <a class="about__credential about__credential--link" href={cred.href} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{cred.label}</a>
        ) : (
          <span class="about__credential">{cred.label}</span>
        )
      )}
    </div>
    <div data-fade data-fade-delay="0.25">
      <p class="text-body-lg about__closer">
        We care about building the right thing, then building it fast.
        And helping founders avoid the expensive mistakes we already paid for.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--color-bg-elevated);
  }

  .about__subtitle {
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about__text {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .about__credentials {
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px;
    max-width: 650px;
  }

  .about__credential {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .about__credential--link {
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .about__credential--link:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .about__closer {
    color: var(--color-text);
    max-width: 650px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
</style>
